---
title: "JRN-001 AP-003 — Account Switching via CASS (7-Working-Day SLA)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor PER001 as PER-001<br/>Personal Customer
    participant Channel as Channel<br/>Web/Mobile Portal (CAP-007)
    participant CAP001 as CAP-001 API<br/>Retail Banking
    participant CAP005 as CAP-005 API<br/>Compliance
    participant CASS as CASS<br/>Pay.UK CASS Service
    participant PREVBANK as Previous Bank<br/>(e.g. Barclays)
    participant EB as Event Bus<br/>SVC-102

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over PER001,CAP001: PH-001 — Application Initiation (CASS switch selected)
        PER001->>Channel: Submit application form<br/>switching: true<br/>intended_switch_date: 2026-04-24<br/>previous_bank: Barclays 20-00-00 / 12345678
        Channel->>CAP001: POST /applications<br/>{ switching: true, cass_switch: { intended_switch_date,<br/>previous_bank_name, previous_sort_code: 200000,<br/>previous_account_number: 12345678 } }
        Note over CAP001: Validate: intended_switch_date >= 7 working days from today<br/>Create ENT-007 ApplicationRecord (switching: true)
        CAP001->>EB: Publish ApplicationStarted { switching: true }
        CAP001-->>Channel: 201 Created { application_id, application_ref }
        Channel-->>PER001: Confirmation + CASS switch details summary
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over EB,CAP005: PH-002 + PH-003 — Identity Verification + KYC/CDD (same as happy path)
        EB-)CAP005: Initiate identity verification and CDD
        Note over CAP005: PH-002: IdentityVerificationCompleted (PASS) published<br/>PH-003: Sanctions screen — CLEAR<br/>KycAssessment (risk_category: simplified)
        CAP005->>EB: Publish KYCClearanceGranted { risk_category: simplified }
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over EB,CAP001: PH-004 — Account Decision: APPROVED
        EB-)CAP001: Consume KYCClearanceGranted
        CAP001->>EB: Publish ApplicationDecisionMade { outcome: APPROVED }
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
        Note over CAP001,CASS: PH-005 — Account Provisioning + CASS Registration
        Note over CAP001: Create ENT-004 Account:<br/>sort_code: 40-47-84, account_number: 87654321<br/>balance: £0.00, fscs_eligible: true
        CAP001->>CASS: Register new account with Pay.UK CASS<br/>{ new_sort_code: 40-47-84, new_account_number: 87654321,<br/>customer_name, DOB, intended_switch_date: 2026-04-24,<br/>previous_sort_code: 200000, previous_account: 12345678 }
        Note over CASS: SLA: Must register within 2 business days<br/>of account opening (CASS rules)
        CASS-->>CAP001: CASS registration confirmed<br/>{ switch_ref: CASS-2026-0042391, switch_date: 2026-04-24 }
        Note over CAP001: Account.cass_registered = true
        CAP001->>EB: Publish AccountProvisioned<br/>{ cass_registered: true, switch_ref: CASS-2026-0042391,<br/>switch_date: 2026-04-24 }
        CAP001->>EB: Publish CardIssuanceTriggered { card_id, account_id, card_type: debit }
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 245)
        Note over PER001,CAP001: PH-006 — Digital Channel Activation (same as happy path)
        PER001->>Channel: Set up credentials + register FIDO2/WebAuthn device
        Channel->>CAP001: POST /customers/{id}/credentials + FIDO2 registration
        Note over CAP001: Credentials created; FIDO2 device registered
        CAP001->>EB: Publish DigitalChannelActivated
    end

    rect rgb(255, 255, 220)
        Note over PER001,Channel: PH-007 — Welcome + CASS Switch Confirmation
        Note over EB: Route events → Notifications (SVC-053):<br/>Welcome email + in-app:<br/>Account details (40-47-84 / 87654321)<br/>CASS Switch Reference: CASS-2026-0042391<br/>Switch Date: 24 April 2026<br/>What will move: Direct Debits + Standing Orders + incoming payments<br/>CASS guarantee: 7-working-day SLA confirmed
    end

    rect rgb(220, 235, 255)
        Note over PER001,CASS: Customer authorises CASS switch form in-app
        PER001->>Channel: Authorise CASS switch form (SCA: biometric + device)<br/>Consent: move DDs + SOs + incoming payments<br/>Consent: close old account on Switch Date
        Note over Channel: SCA required (PSR 2017 Regulation 100)
        Channel->>CAP001: POST /accounts/{id}/cass-switch/authorise<br/>{ switch_ref, authorised_at }
        CAP001->>CASS: Transmit authorised CASS switch instruction<br/>{ switch_ref: CASS-2026-0042391, authorised_at,<br/>switch_date: 2026-04-24 }
    end

    rect rgb(200, 240, 220)
        Note over CASS,PREVBANK: CASS 7-Working-Day Switch Window<br/>(Day 0 to Switch Date: 2026-04-24)
        CASS->>PREVBANK: Request mandate list (Direct Debits + Standing Orders)
        PREVBANK-->>CASS: Mandate list returned
        CASS->>CASS: Redirect all mandates to 40-47-84 / 87654321
        Note over CASS,PREVBANK: SLA: Must complete within 7 working days<br/>of Switch Date (CASS guarantee)
    end

    rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
        Note over CASS,PER001: Switch Date: 2026-04-24
        CASS->>PREVBANK: Instruct: close old account (20-00-00 / 12345678)<br/>Transfer remaining balance to new account
        PREVBANK-->>CASS: Old account closed, balance transferred
        CASS-->>CAP001: Switch completion notification<br/>{ switch_ref: CASS-2026-0042391,<br/>switch_completed_at: 2026-04-24T17:00:00Z, status: completed }
        CAP001->>EB: Publish CassSwitchCompleted<br/>{ account_id, switch_ref, switch_completed_at, within_sla: true }
        Note over EB: Route CassSwitchCompleted → Notifications (SVC-053):<br/>Email + in-app: "Your switch is complete.<br/>Your Barclays account has been closed.<br/>Sort code/account: 40-47-84 / 87654321"
    end

    Note over PER001,CASS: AP-003 complete — CASS switch finished within 7-working-day SLA<br/>CASS redirect protection active for 3 years from Switch Date
